        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "仲良くなれたらいいな～！\n好きなお菓子とかあるのかな～？",
            "enText": "I wonder if it's friendly? Do you think \nit has a favorite snack?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
